# Nothing in this folder is served to a browser.
#
# This file also exists to make the deploy create the folder at all. It used to
# be a .gitkeep, and the FTPS deploy excludes **/.git* which matches .gitkeep,
# so every one of these directories was silently missing on the server after the
# first release. An .htaccess is not excluded, so the folder arrives and arrives
# locked.
Require all denied
